abstract: "A red/blue colouring of the complete graph on 1641 vertices with no monochromatic K_12, so R(12,12) ≥ 1642. It adds one vertex to Tatarevic's two-parameter Ramsey increment applied to the Mathon colouring M(797). Includes a Lean 4 proof accepted by two independent kernels and an exhaustive computer search. The work was done with Claude (Claude Opus 5.5, Anthropic); see the README."
